# Simple recursive type alias: [List: [type [head: Integer  tail: List]]]
# should register successfully. The recursive `tail` field position uses a fresh TypeVar
# (the mu-variable) instead of expanding infinitely or returning Unknown.
# At runtime, the type alias evaluates to an empty dict; the field `result` is an Int.
[
  List: [type [head: Integer  tail: List]]
  result: 42
]
=== out
Dict({"List": Dict({}), "result": Int(42)})
